# Vendored UAPI headers for the BPF build

The BPF objects compile with `-nostdinc`, so every header outside
clang's own resource directory is vendored here. These 13 files are
byte-exact copies from the installed `linux-libc-dev` package; do not
edit them. `asm/` holds the x86-64 arch headers (the build targets
x86-64 only); `linux/` and `asm-generic/` keep their include paths.

Source package: linux-libc-dev:amd64
Source version: 7.0.0-38.38
License: GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-note (see the SPDX line in each file)

